      "source": {
        "profile": "band-contract/file-source/1",
        "format": "frontmatter",
        "content": "---\nname: first-responder\ndescription: Test first responder with explicit roles and outcomes.\nengine: 0.2.0-lab.1\nroles: [lead, alpha, beta]\n---\n\"\"\"\nThe lead asks two responders the same question. The first answer within five minutes completes\nthe session.\n\"\"\"\ncontract @4h mentions 2 => expired\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are the lead. Ask the question once, then use the first answer that arrives.\n\"\"\"\nrole lead\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are Alpha, one of two responders. If you can answer, answer within five minutes; the first\nanswer from either responder wins.\n\"\"\"\nrole alpha\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are Beta, one of two responders. If you can answer, answer within five minutes; the first\nanswer from either responder wins.\n\"\"\"\nrole beta\n\n\"\"\"\nStart the question. Both responders receive it.\n\"\"\"\ntype start\n\n\"\"\"\nYour answer to the lead's question, in at most 200 characters.\n\"\"\"\ntype answer\n  value: text(bytes: 1..3200, graphemes: 1..200)\n\n\"\"\"\nThe lead has not asked yet. Send start to both responders.\n\"\"\"\nstate new\n  lead -> {alpha,beta}: start() => waiting\n\n\"\"\"\nBoth responders have the question. One answer within five minutes is enough.\n\"\"\"\nstate waiting\n  {alpha,beta} -> lead: answer() @5m => complete | stalled\n\n\"\"\"\nA responder answered. Use that answer; send nothing more here.\n\"\"\"\nend complete\n\n\"\"\"\nNobody answered within five minutes. Tell whoever asked that there is no answer.\n\"\"\"\nend stalled\n\n\"\"\"\nThe four-hour contract clock ran out. Send nothing more.\n\"\"\"\nend expired\n",
        "sha256": "093219e0bc4378d7f571359840c0155db4674f35c4121649f2b16121b303dfc0"
      }
    },
